BT /F2 15 Tf 55 784 Td (My life story) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 760 Td (Take your time with these. Write in your journal over a few days, as much or as little as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 745 Td (feels right. There are no right answers: just be honest with yourself.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 720 Td (1. When did you smoke your first cigarette? How old were you, where were you, and who) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 705 Td (were you with?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 672 Td (2. What was happening in your life at that time?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 639 Td (3. How long have you smoked? How has it changed over the years: times you smoked more,) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 624 Td (less, or stopped for a while?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 591 Td (4. What do you smoke now \(cigarettes, roll-ups, vapes, cigars\), how much, and when?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 558 Td (5. What is smoking a replacement for? What does it give you that you don't get another) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 543 Td (way: a break, comfort, company, calm, a reward, time to yourself?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 510 Td (6. Which emotions most often lead you to smoke: stress, boredom, loneliness, anger,) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 495 Td (sadness, celebration?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 462 Td (7. Who in your family smoked, or smokes? What did you learn about smoking growing up?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 429 Td (8. What have you tried before to stop, and what did you learn from it?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 396 Td (9. What does smoking cost you: your health, money, energy, relationships, how you feel) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 381 Td (about yourself?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 55 348 Td (10. What has brought you to this group, now?) Tj ET
